  "body": "We should pass an `AbortSignal` object to underling sink `write()` calls and signal abort if the stream is aborted. `write()` implementations could either ignore it (giving the existing behaviour), or reject the promise they returned, making the abort operation complete more quickly than it would otherwise.\r\n\r\nThis would also work with `pipeTo()` abort (as long as _preventAbort_ was not set).",
